      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but it's looking a bit thin on the actual taxonomic detail. the software flagged this version as 'low quality' because the scientific name count is too low. \n\ncan you expand the summary? i need you to go into more depth with the species descriptions to make it a more substantial section. just make sure you're actually describing the interactions and the health of the site like i said before, don't just dump a list of names, but i need those binomial names in there to hit that quality threshold.",
